Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.76,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:52.93,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I in the dream of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:21.88,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1180,0)}All in for it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:26.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,失うものなど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:29.72,OPJP,,0,0,0,,All in for it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:35.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,あれは誰の夢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:40.40,OPJP,,0,0,0,,この世の全て　その手で総べて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:45.44,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Are you happy now? What did you get to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:50.53,OPJP,,0,0,0,,There was hope in your hands, When you played in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:53.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,もう何もないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:58.87,OPJP,,0,0,0,,愛も未来も
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:03.84,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.84,0:03:09.17,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)}Am I in the dream of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:47.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我是否在梦中化作了蝴蝶?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:52.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,,亦或是本就身处蝴蝶的梦境?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:21.88,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1180,0)}倾注一切  孤注一掷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:26.01,OPCN,,0,0,0,,又有什么可失去的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:29.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,倾注一切  孤注一掷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:35.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,那究竟是谁的梦境?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:40.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,将世间万物  皆由你之手执掌统治
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:45.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,如今的你幸福吗?  你又为此付出了怎样的代价?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:50.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,,忆往昔于沙中嬉戏之时  你的掌心曾满载着希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:53.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,而如今早已一无所有
